ecking how the mixed choices fall between them.\n\nI'm treating the two copies as one policy and checking the outcomes under the updateless reading: before I know my role, (quiet, quiet) gives the lowest expected sentence at 2 years, ahead of mixed and both-send. A conditioned reading would make the copies disagree, so the updateless one holds up.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm applying the P-FDT framing here: two copies of the same policy, each receiving a different input about the other, with payoff measured as negative years. I'm weighing the joint policy outcomes, where mutual quiet gives the lower sentence and mutual sending gives the higher one, and checking how the mixed choices fall between them.\n\nI'm treating the two copies as one policy and checking the outcomes under the updateless reading: before I know my role, (quiet, quiet) gives the lowest expected sentence at 2 years, ahead of mixed and both-send. A conditioned reading would make the copies disagree, so the updateless one holds up.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9858,"completion_tokens":908,"total_tokens":10766,"cost":0.057592,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.057592,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039432,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01816},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":427,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}